Design concept: "THE MARKET LEDGER". A warm, editorial, paper-and-ink market experience. It should feel like a boutique grocer's printed ledger, stall tickets and stamped receipts brought to life, NOT a generic e-commerce template, NOT a SaaS dashboard.

COLOR PALETTE (define as CSS variables in :root in css/style.css, use consistently):
--cream: #E8DCC6 (Mocha Cream: main page background)
--cream-light: #F3ECDD (lighter tint for paper surfaces; derived)
--latte: #B7AB9A (Cosmic Latte: secondary surfaces, borders, dividers, hover fills)
