Rules: ensure WCAG AA contrast for text (use ink/burgundy-dark on cream; white/cream on burgundy). Never use pure black or pure white backgrounds. No rainbow gradients. At most one very subtle paper-grain texture (inline SVG noise, opacity ≤ 6%) on the page background.

TYPOGRAPHY
- Display/headings: "Fraunces" (variable serif, use optical size and soft/wonk for personality), big editorial scale with tight leading and negative letter-spacing on hero.
- UI/body: "DM Sans".
- Prices, codes, quantities, receipt: "DM Mono" (tabular numerals, giving a ledger feel). Invite code displayed like a stamped ticket in mono, uppercase, letter-spaced.
